  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mata Da Kwach Peanut Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the grant, the union will strengthen its organizational, managerial, and institutional capacities. A semi-industrial production unit will be installed and will allow the union to increase its production in quantity and quality of peanut oil. Given that Hannou Ga Zan is a village which is close to several important markets of the Maradi region, the presence of these markets is an opportunity that will provided the union Mata da Kwach to sell its production of oil and peanut cake. The grant will allow through the establishment of a substantial working capital. Marketing training will allow the union to increase its revenues by increasing sales</narrative>
  </description>
